# Workflow plan steps W2 and W3 (docs/WORKFLOW_PLAN.md, 2026-11-14): a tutorial read into Physics > Setup, and boundaries in
# physical words. The cavity (icoFoam): Physics offers "Read it into Setup"; once read, Setup shows the case (laminar,
# transient, the lid a moving wall) and what it kept as written; Boundary conditions shows each boundary by what it is,
# with the patch-by-field table behind Every field. The lid's speed changed there: the steps bar asks to write again, its
# Next writes the case files, the table shows the new value, and the case runs.
open $SB/ws/cavity
wait 10
click wf-next
wait-until job finished timeout 60
wait 20
click nav:boundary conditions
wait 10
assert widget bc-adopt
assert text See these as inlets, outlets and walls
click nav:physics
wait 10
assert widget phys-adopt
screenshot $OUT/physics_offer.png
click phys-adopt
wait 20
assert text Setup read the case
assert text Read from the case's own files
assert text The case files match this setup
assert text Kept as the case has it
assert file $SB/ws/cavity/simulation.ini
assert file $SB/ws/cavity/.qc-setup/adopted
# nothing written to the case yet: the bar has Physics done
assert not text Setup changed: write again
screenshot $OUT/setup_adopted.png
click su-adopt-notes
wait 5
assert text icoFoam
screenshot $OUT/setup_notes.png
click nav:boundary conditions
wait 10
assert widget bc-every
assert text movingWall
assert text Moving
screenshot $OUT/bc_roles.png
click bc-every
wait 10
# the table: the case's own condition for the lid, as the tutorial writes it
assert text fixedValue
screenshot $OUT/bc_every.png
click bc-every
wait 10
# the lid twice as fast, on its card
click su-b#0>movingWall>wall-u#0
key A ctrl
enter 2
wait 10
shell grep -q 'wall_velocity = 2 0 0' $SB/ws/cavity/simulation.ini && touch $OUT/edited
assert file $OUT/edited
wait 10
assert text Setup changed: write again
click wf-next
wait 30
shell grep -q '(2 0 0)' $SB/ws/cavity/0/U && touch $OUT/written
assert file $OUT/written
shell grep -q 'icoFoam' $SB/ws/cavity/system/controlDict && touch $OUT/still-ico
assert file $OUT/still-ico
click nav:run
wait-until page Run
click run-go
wait-until job finished timeout 120
wait 20
assert text Finished
